# A trapped book in a bag next to the Avatar: when it is closed the blast
# hurts whoever stands close to the bag (not around the book's place in
# the bag's window); the armour softens it (the cheat's magic shield keeps
# the fire part off)
args: --cheat --map 37 --pos 14655,2883,64
do: t1;place:637,0,14600,2900,64;putin:31580,613,18,40;t1;use:31581;t10
do: page;page;page;page;page;page;page;page;page;page;t100;hp
expect: actor 1: hp 25 dex 15 side 2 enemies 0
